tps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499520/extras/eeadba7410cf5612f131ca0ee4944fce.mp4?t=1754850195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch how Moriana breaks the fourth wall and interacts with you between crusades. She\u2019s magnetic, cruel, and completely unhinged \u2014 and she has more power over you than you think.<br><br> Enjoy fully voiced dialogue scenes with a talented cast, including Amber Lee Connors as Moriana, Ryan Cooper as Richard III Ovine, and Jacob Browning as the Devil himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack by Davi Vasc fuses metal, jazz, and classical into a high-octane mix that fuels your wicked conquest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PRAISE BE MORIANA!</strong></p>",
